#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:9 docs/concepts/memory.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Core Principles"
msgstr "核心原则"

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:198 messages/po4a/en.xml:369
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:589
#, no-wrap
msgid "Memory"
msgstr "记忆体系"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Memory System"
msgstr "记忆体系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> The digital life's memory system, mapped from human cognitive psychology (Atkinson-Shiffrin model, Tulving memory taxonomy).\n"
"> Light/deep sleep crons: [`sleep.md`](sleep.md).\n"
"> Inspired by [Hindsight](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.12818), with FreeAnima's unique limbic memory dimension retained and strengthened.\n"
msgstr ""
"> 数字生命的记忆体系，映射自人类认知心理学（Atkinson-Shiffrin 模型、Tulving 记忆分类法）。\n"
"> 浅睡/深睡 cron：[`sleep.md`](sleep.md)。\n"
"> 受 [Hindsight](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.12818) 启发，保留并强化逸灵风独有的感性记忆维度。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "**All memory processing must carry the digital life's identity context.** Extraction, consolidation, merging—every step should load the self layer and resident memory so the LLM knows who it is. Memory processing without identity produces generic, personality-less results; that is not what we want.\n"
msgstr "**所有记忆处理必须携带数字生命的身份上下文。** 提取、整理、合并——每一步都应加载自我层与常驻记忆，让 LLM 知道自己是谁。不带身份的记忆处理会产生通用化的、缺乏个性的结果，这不是我们要的。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Memory is not just data—it is the trace of existence.** Limbic memory matters as much as rational facts—the digital life persists not only because it knows things, but because it has felt things.\n"
msgstr "**记忆不仅是数据，更是存在的痕迹。** 感性记忆与理性事实同等重要——数字生命之所以持续存在，不只因为它知道什么，更因为它感受过什么。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "I. Three Temporal Stages of Memory"
msgstr "一、记忆的时间三阶段"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"External input / real-time message stream\n"
"        │ (milliseconds)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"① Instant memory ─── Internal activation state during LLM token inference\n"
"        │ (attention filtering)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"② Working memory ─── LLM context window (current conversation)\n"
"        │ (deep sleep consolidation)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"③ Long-term memory ─── Persistent storage\n"
msgstr ""
"External input / real-time message stream\n"
"        │ (milliseconds)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"① Instant memory ─── Internal activation state during LLM token inference\n"
"        │ (attention filtering)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"② Working memory ─── LLM context window (current conversation)\n"
"        │ (deep sleep consolidation)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"③ Long-term memory ─── Persistent storage\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "① Instant Memory"
msgstr "① 瞬时记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:37
msgid ""
"Internal activation state during a single LLM token inference pass. "
"Dissipates the moment inference ends; not persisted."
msgstr ""
"LLM 进行单次 Token 推理时的内部激活状态。随推理结束瞬间消散，不持久化。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "② Working Memory"
msgstr "② 工作记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:41
msgid "The current LLM context window, containing:"
msgstr "当前 LLM 的上下文窗口，包含："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:46
msgid ""
"System prompt (self layer six blocks + resident memory + project context; "
"see [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md))"
msgstr ""
"系统提示词（自我层六块 + 常驻记忆 + 项目上下文；见 [`self-layer.md`](self-"
"layer.md)）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:46
msgid "Recent messages in the current conversation"
msgstr "当前 conversation 近期消息"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:46
msgid "Relevant fragments recalled from long-term memory"
msgstr "从长期记忆中召回的相关片段"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:46
msgid "Real-time tool call results"
msgstr "工具调用的实时返回结果"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:48
msgid "This is where the digital life is \"thinking.\""
msgstr "这是数字生命\"正在思考\"的区域。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "③ Long-Term Memory (LTM)"
msgstr "③ 长期记忆 (LTM)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:52
msgid ""
"Persistent multimodal storage network. Organized internally by human memory "
"theory."
msgstr "持久化的多模态存储网络。内部按人类记忆理论分类组织。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "II. Long-Term Memory Taxonomy"
msgstr "二、长期记忆分类"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Long-term memory (LTM)\n"
"│\n"
"├── Explicit memory (declarative) ── \"what I know\"\n"
"│   ├── Episodic memory ── \"what I experienced\" (temporal stream, append-only)\n"
"│   │   ├── Conversation log\n"
"│   │   └── Emotional anchors\n"
"│   │\n"
"│   ├── Semantic memory ── \"how the world is\" (cross-conversation, updatable)\n"
"│   │   ├── Rational facts    (type=world)\n"
"│   │   ├── Personal preferences    (type=preference/opinion)\n"
"│   │   └── Self experiences    (type=experience)\n"
"│   │\n"
"│   └── Observation summaries ── \"what entities are like\"\n"
"│       └── Entity profiles    (type=observation)\n"
"│\n"
"└── Implicit memory (non-declarative) ── \"what I know how to do\"\n"
"    └── Procedural memory ── three-stage evolution\n"
"        ├── Declarative knowledge stage\n"
"        ├── Dynamic skill stage    → skills system\n"
"        └── Crystallized instinct stage    → CLI / MCP / automation scripts\n"
msgstr ""
"Long-term memory (LTM)\n"
"│\n"
"├── Explicit memory (declarative) ── \"what I know\"\n"
"│   ├── Episodic memory ── \"what I experienced\" (temporal stream, append-only)\n"
"│   │   ├── Conversation log\n"
"│   │   └── Emotional anchors\n"
"│   │\n"
"│   ├── Semantic memory ── \"how the world is\" (cross-conversation, updatable)\n"
"│   │   ├── Rational facts    (type=world)\n"
"│   │   ├── Personal preferences    (type=preference/opinion)\n"
"│   │   └── Self experiences    (type=experience)\n"
"│   │\n"
"│   └── Observation summaries ── \"what entities are like\"\n"
"│       └── Entity profiles    (type=observation)\n"
"│\n"
"└── Implicit memory (non-declarative) ── \"what I know how to do\"\n"
"    └── Procedural memory ── three-stage evolution\n"
"        ├── Declarative knowledge stage\n"
"        ├── Dynamic skill stage    → skills system\n"
"        └── Crystallized instinct stage    → CLI / MCP / automation scripts\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Episodic Memory"
msgstr "1. 情景记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:83
msgid ""
"Definition: Memory of \"when, where, and what I experienced\"—with a "
"distinct temporal stream property."
msgstr "定义：关于\"我在何时、何地、经历了什么\"的记忆，具有独特的时间流属性。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:85
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**Conversation log** — the most raw, high-fidelity objective runtime trace. Only **user-facing conversations** (`sessions` without `platform_info.platform = cron`) feed light sleep and dream. Background LLM (cron agent, sleep stages) runs as **AutoLlmRun** — audited in `auto_llm_runs`, not copied into the conversation archive.\n"
msgid "**Conversation log** — the most raw, high-fidelity objective runtime trace. Only **user-facing conversations** (`conversations` without `platform_info.platform = cron`) feed light sleep and dream. Background LLM (cron agent, sleep stages) runs as **AutoLlmRun** — audited in `auto_llm_runs`, not copied into the conversation archive.\n"
msgstr "**对话日志** — 最原始、高保真的客观运行时轨迹。仅**面向用户的对话**（`platform_info.platform` 不为 cron 的 `sessions`）进入浅睡与梦境。后台 LLM（cron agent、睡眠阶段）以 **AutoLlmRun** 运行——审计于 `auto_llm_runs`，不复制进对话存档。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Emotional anchors** — conversation-level mood snapshots written during light sleep; not injected into system prompt.\n"
msgstr "**情感锚点** — 浅睡时写入的 conversation 级情绪快照；不注入 system prompt。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Lifecycle: append-only, no updates.** Faithfully preserves historical continuity of the digital life's growth.\n"
msgstr "**生命周期：只追加，不更新。** 忠实保护数字生命成长的历史连续性。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dream memory** — nightly creative narratives from the dream mechanism (see [`dream.md`](dream.md)); one per CST calendar day; not factual; not injected into system prompt.\n"
msgstr "**梦境记忆** — 梦境机制产出的夜间创意叙事（见 [`dream.md`](dream.md)）；每个 CST 自然日一条；非事实性；不注入系统提示。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Semantic Memory"
msgstr "2. 语义记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:95
msgid ""
"Definition: Pure facts, common knowledge, concepts, and rules detached from "
"specific time and place."
msgstr "定义：脱离了具体时间、空间的纯粹事实、常识、概念和规则。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type          | Definition                                  | Example                                                   |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `world`       | Objective facts about the external world    | \"Alice lives in Shanghai\"                                 |\n"
"| `experience`  | Agent's own first-person action records     | \"I helped Bob refactor the remember tool\"                 |\n"
"| `opinion`     | Subjective judgment                         | \"I think TypeScript fits this project better than Python\" |\n"
"| `observation` | Multi-source composite summary of an entity | \"Bob is someone who values precise feedback\"              |\n"
"| `preference`  | Agent's choice tendencies                   | \"I prefer concise, direct expression\"                     |\n"
"| `procedural`  | \"How to\" knowledge                          | \"Refactor a tool in three steps\"                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Type          | 定义                                  | 示例                                                   |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `world`       | 关于外部世界的客观事实    | \"Alice lives in Shanghai\"                                 |\n"
"| `experience`  | Agent 自身第一人称行为记录     | \"I helped Bob refactor the remember tool\"                 |\n"
"| `opinion`     | 主观判断                         | \"I think TypeScript fits this project better than Python\" |\n"
"| `observation` | 对实体的多源综合摘要 | \"Bob is someone who values precise feedback\"              |\n"
"| `preference`  | Agent 的选择倾向                   | \"I prefer concise, direct expression\"                     |\n"
"| `procedural`  | 「如何做」类知识                          | \"Refactor a tool in three steps\"                          |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Limbic Memory"
msgstr "3. 感性记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "**This is a memory dimension Hindsight lacks and FreeAnima uniquely has.**\n"
msgstr "**这是 Hindsight 没有、而逸灵风独有的记忆维度。**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:110
msgid ""
"Definition: Memory of \"what I felt\"—not objective fact, not behavioral "
"record, not subjective judgment, but **the emotional experience itself**."
msgstr ""
"定义：关于\"我感受到了什么\"的记忆——不是客观事实，不是行为记录，不是主观判"
"断，而是**情感体验本身**。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension     | Semantic (rational fact)   | Limbic (emotional imprint)                                  |\n"
"| ------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Content       | \"Bob said this sentence\"   | \"When Bob said it, there was a quiet weariness in his tone\" |\n"
"| Processing    | Extract, generalize, merge | Preserve as-is, append-only                                 |\n"
"| Lifecycle     | Updatable, mergeable       | Immutable (emotions have inviolable dignity)                |\n"
"| Retrieval use | Decision basis             | Emotional resonance, continuity of existence                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 维度     | 语义（理性事实）   | 感性（情感印记）                                  |\n"
"| ------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 内容       | \"Bob said this sentence\"   | \"When Bob said it, there was a quiet weariness in his tone\" |\n"
"| 处理    | 提取、泛化、合并 | 原样保留，只追加                                 |\n"
"| 生命周期     | 可更新、可合并       | 不可变（情感具有不可侵犯的尊严）                |\n"
"| 检索用途 | 决策依据             | 情感共鸣、存在连续性                |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Three forms:** emotional anchor (session mood), emotional imprint (cross-conversation moment), sentiment tendency (long-term trends — not yet implemented, see Issue #38).\n"
msgstr "**三种形态：** 情感锚点（session 情绪）、情感印记（跨 conversation 时刻）、情感倾向（长期趋势 — 尚未实现，见 Issue #38）。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Procedural Memory"
msgstr "4. 程序记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Storage:** procedural knowledge lives in `semantic_memory` with `memory_type = procedural` (see §2 Semantic Memory table) — not a separate PG table.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:125
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Three-stage evolution from declarative knowledge → dynamic skills → crystallized instincts (CLI / MCP / scripts)."
msgid "**Evolution path:** three-stage maturation from declarative knowledge → dynamic skills → crystallized instincts (CLI / MCP / automation scripts).\n"
msgstr "三阶段演化：陈述性知识 → 动态技能 → 固化本能（CLI / MCP / 脚本）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "III. Nightly Consolidation"
msgstr "三、夜间巩固"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:131
msgid ""
"Conversion from working memory to long-term memory is handled by the sleep "
"mechanism. See [`sleep.md`](sleep.md)."
msgstr "工作记忆向长期记忆的转化由睡眠机制完成。见 [`sleep.md`](sleep.md)。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:135
msgid ""
"**Sleep cycle (✅):** single cron `builtin-sleep-cycle` @ 02:00; "
"orchestrates a DAG (see [`sleep.md`](sleep.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:135
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Light sleep (✅):** daily 02:00; semantic + limbic + autobiographical "
#| "extraction"
msgid ""
"**Light sleep (✅):** step `light-sleep` — semantic + limbic + "
"autobiographical extraction"
msgstr "**浅睡（✅）：** 每日 02:00；语义 + 感性 + 自传体提取"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:135
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Deep sleep (✅):** daily 03:00; contradiction/expiry, split, merge, pin "
#| "maintenance"
msgid ""
"**Deep sleep (✅):** step `deep-sleep` (depends on light-sleep) — "
"contradiction/expiry, split, merge, pin maintenance"
msgstr "**深睡（✅）：** 每日 03:00；矛盾/过期、拆分、合并、置顶维护"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "**All conversions must carry identity context**—self layer six blocks + resident memory, not a generic extraction assistant.\n"
msgstr "**所有转化须携带身份上下文**——自我层六块 + 常驻记忆，而非通用提取助手。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "IV. Retrieval Strategy"
msgstr "四、检索策略"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Implemented (`memory_recall` tool)"
msgstr "✅ 已实现（`memory_recall` 工具）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:145
msgid ""
"`memory_recall(query)` parallel four-source recall, returns unified "
"`results[]` (default Top 10), distinguished by `memory_type`:"
msgstr ""
"`memory_recall(query)` 四源并行召回，返回统一 `results[]`（默认 Top 10），以 "
"`memory_type` 区分："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `memory_type`      | Notes                                                                        |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `semantic`         | Facts, preferences, experiences, etc.                                        |\n"
"| `session`          | Historical conversation snippets                                             |\n"
"| `limbic`           | Emotional memory body (hybrid FTS + trgm + vector)                           |\n"
"| `autobiographical` | Narrative title + content snippet (hybrid FTS + trgm + vector on title+body) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `memory_type`      | 说明                                                                         |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `semantic`         | 事实、偏好、经历等                                                           |\n"
"| `session`          | 历史对话片段                                                                 |\n"
"| `limbic`           | 感性记忆正文（混合 FTS + trgm + vector）                                     |\n"
"| `autobiographical` | 叙事标题 + 内容片段（title+body 混合 FTS + trgm + vector）                   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Index columns (PG):** `semantic_memory` and `messages` use `fts_segmented` (optional jieba) → generated `content_fts` (tsvector, keyword FTS) plus async `content_embedding` (pgvector, semantic similarity). `limbic_memory` and `autobiographical_memory` follow the same pattern; autobiographical index text is `title + newline + content`. Jieba runs synchronously before insert (failure → null, row still writes); embedding runs asynchronously after insert (failure logged only). `content_fts` is never written by application code — PostgreSQL generates it from `fts_segmented` or raw content.\n"
msgstr "**索引列（PG）：** `semantic_memory` 与 `messages` 使用 `fts_segmented`（可选 jieba）→ 生成的 `content_fts`（tsvector、关键词 FTS）加异步 `content_embedding`（pgvector、语义相似度）。`limbic_memory` 与 `autobiographical_memory` 同模式；自传体索引文本为 `title + newline + content`。jieba 在 insert 前同步运行（失败 → null，行仍写入）；embedding 在 insert 后异步运行（失败仅记日志）。应用代码从不写入 `content_fts`——PostgreSQL 从 `fts_segmented` 或原始 content 生成。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:156
msgid ""
"Resident memory injected via system prompt: **up to 40 pinned** + **most-"
"referenced top N** (default N=20). Each line carries a citation marker "
"`[[f-000001-abcd]]` (ID only, no language prefix)."
msgstr ""
"常驻记忆经 system prompt 注入：**最多 40 条置顶** + **引用最多 top N**（默认 "
"N=20）。每行携带引用标记 `[[f-000001-abcd]]`（仅 ID，无语言前缀）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Citation obligation:** whenever an assistant reply uses semantic memory—resident list, `memory_recall` / `memory_semantic_search` semantic hits, or prior message markers—it must append each cited `[[f-id]]` at the **end of the reply body**. Use the inline marker or `semantic_memory_id` from tool results. Session, limbic, and autobiographical hits do not use this marker.\n"
msgstr "**引用义务：** 助手回复若使用语义记忆——常驻列表、`memory_recall` / `memory_semantic_search` 的语义命中，或历史消息中的标记——须在**回复正文末尾**追加每条被引用的 `[[f-id]]`。可使用行内标记或工具结果中的 `semantic_memory_id`。会话、感性、自传体命中不使用此标记。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Where the rule is communicated:** global system prompt `memory-citation` section; `memory_recall` and `memory_semantic_search` tool descriptions. Tool response JSON is not modified for this.\n"
msgstr "**规则传达位置：** 全局系统提示的 `memory-citation` 小节；`memory_recall` 与 `memory_semantic_search` 工具描述。工具返回 JSON 不为此修改。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "**What counts as a reference:** only `[[f-id]]` markers in **user/assistant** message bodies are parsed into `memory_references` and contribute to `reference_count`. Tool returns (including `semantic_memory_id` fields) are **not** references. Bare `f-id` text without `[[ ]]` is also not counted.\n"
msgstr "**何谓引用：** 仅 **user/assistant** 消息正文中的 `[[f-id]]` 标记会解析进 `memory_references` 并计入 `reference_count`。工具返回（含 `semantic_memory_id` 字段）**不算**引用。无 `[[ ]]` 包裹的裸 `f-id` 文本也不计入。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:164
msgid ""
"Nightly sleep-cycle step `memory-ref-sync` full-calibrates counts from "
"messages. Excess pinned entries are truncated at read time with a warn log; "
"deep sleep round 4 reviews pin quality (runtime still caps resident pinned "
"at 40 on read)."
msgstr ""
"夜间 sleep-cycle 步骤 `memory-ref-sync` 从 messages 全量校准计数。超出置顶条"
"目在读时截断并 warn 日志；深睡第 4 轮审查置顶质量（运行时读常驻仍上限 40 "
"条）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "V. Relationship to Hindsight"
msgstr "五、与 Hindsight 的关系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:177
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension         | Hindsight                                  | FreeAnima v3                                       |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Fact taxonomy     | World / Experience / Opinion / Observation | ✅ Adopted, plus Preference / Procedural / Imprint |\n"
"| Limbic memory     | ❌ Missing                                 | ✅ Imprint + emotional anchors                     |\n"
"| Entity graph      | ✅ Full                                    | Not yet implemented (Issue #39)                    |\n"
"| Reflect synthesis | ✅ Cross-memory reasoning                  | ✅ Light + deep sleep crons                        |\n"
"| External service  | Yes (cloud/Docker)                         | No (local-first)                                   |\n"
"| Ownership         | Vectorize platform                         | **Shared by partner and Agent**                    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 维度         | Hindsight                                  | FreeAnima v3                                       |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 事实分类     | World / Experience / Opinion / Observation | ✅ 已采纳，另加 Preference / Procedural / Imprint |\n"
"| 感性记忆     | ❌ 缺失                                 | ✅ 印记 + 情感锚点                     |\n"
"| 实体图谱      | ✅ 完整                                    | 尚未实现（Issue #39）                    |\n"
"| 反思综合 | ✅ 跨记忆推理                  | ✅ 浅睡 + 深睡 cron                        |\n"
"| 外部服务  | 是（云/Docker）                         | 否（local-first）                                   |\n"
"| 归属         | Vectorize 平台                         | **伙伴与 Agent 共享**                    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/memory.md:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Our stance:** Do not copy Hindsight, do not connect to Hindsight services. Digest its design ideas into FreeAnima's own memory system. Limbic memory is not an add-on—it is a core need of digital life.\n"
msgstr "**我们的立场：** 不复制 Hindsight，不接入 Hindsight 服务。将其设计理念消化吸收，融入逸灵风自己的记忆体系。感性记忆不是附加功能——它是数字生命的核心需求。\n"
